76475692, "y": 0.18841569788339263, "x": 0.2754919584521474, "h": 0.010239536904255879}, {"text": "play put", "y": 0.20206367320975338, "x": 0.132290543990904, "w": 0.07352266947428385, "h": 0.013169165466666717}, {"w": 0.025044723086886933, "h": 0.007587208988864391, "text": "use", "y": 0.2035901163725736, "x": 0.2254025046014581}, {"w": 0.03756708357069227, "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "y": 0.203590116499027, "text": "wear", "x": 0.26475849710105814}, {"w": 0.32558139377170137, "x": 0.10554561948266449, "h": 0.01156798308937126, "y": 0.23773255851689087, "text": "Extract from Students' Book recording ) 2.35-2.36"}, {"text": "Jane: Now, you must always wait on / in the corridor", "y": 0.254011732692148, "w": 0.35062611897786455, "h": 0.011540592616215461, "x": 0.10554562022484222}, {"y": 0.2680813955459969, "h": 0.011449290415009824, "w": 0.33273701985677084, "text": "outside this room until the teacher comes. Students", "x": 0.15205725368521023}, {"x": 0.15026833640529302, "h": 0.011485811295492138, "text": "mustn't be in the room without / alone a teacher.", "y": 0.2818862814610545, "w": 0.3202146742078993}, {"text": "There is a lot of special equipment here. Students", "x": 0.14847942558319094, "w": 0.323792487250434, "y": 0.294449458414368, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.29874776204427084, "y": 0.3097608304813688, "text": "do experiments on / in Chemistry and Physics", "x": 0.15026834033296294}, {"y": 0.32372093044319433, "text": "lessons. You mustn't touch anything until the teacher", "x": 0.14847942604018555, "h": 0.0127366508903917, "w": 0.34347049289279513}, {"x": 0.14834946775623917, "w": 0.07897190517849392, "y": 0.3372139891500861, "h": 0.013478998759162935, "text": "tells you to."}, {"w": 0.2164579603407118, "y": 0.35019855612439255, "x": 0.10196779762928632, "h": 0.011458420447924517, "text": "Mark: What are all those books?"}, {"y": 0.36545058172573014, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.037567083570692286, "text": "Jane:", "x": 0.10375670922836881}, {"y": 0.3641860468044588, "x": 0.14311269687120526, "w": 0.323792487250434, "h": 0.012709260417235902, "text": "We keep all the Science books here, so everyone"}, {"h": 0.010207581227436872, "y": 0.3780731046711743, "x": 0.15026834187795418, "w": 0.27191413031684025, "text": "can use them in the lessons. You have to"}, {"text": "an overall din/ for here too over your school uniform,", "y": 0.3906362819319686, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.3398926459418403, "x": 0.1502683494798848}, {"h": 0.012645348314774242, "text": "to protect it. L...", "y": 0.40591569806208966, "x": 0.14669052000598246, "w": 0.11091233995225694}, {"h": 0.012695564431834358, "x": 0.15026833488911437, "text": "This is my favourite place in the school. I meet my", "w": 0.318425767686632, "y": 0.41851083061965577}, {"h": 0.01428914063243661, "w": 0.31516845703124996, "x": 0.14831810600952774, "y": 0.43107461229356314, "text": "friends here on / in the breaks and we usually sit"}, {"y": 0.4451162787508635, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "x": 0.14669051639013914, "w": 0.3291592068142361, "text": "fover / away there. Teachers don't often come here"}, {"text": "because it's always very noisy - they prefer the staff", "w": 0.33094811333550345, "x": 0.14669051884655965, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "y": 0.4601263534409873}, {"h": 0.015174154391787965, "y": 0.4729889957562841, "text": "room! You can buy all kinds of food and drinks here,", "x": 0.14479023656835932, "w": 0.33836998833550347}, {"y": 0.48800090239874305, "x": 0.14669052236094243, "w": 0.31127010769314234, "h": 0.011490376499155443, "text": "so remember to bring your money! We take our"}, {"w": 0.3363148328993056, "y": 0.5005640791942124, "text": "food and sit in / on the playground when the sun is", "x": 0.14669052075964967, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"y": 0.5157773246441014, "x": 0.14485404054099377, "w": 0.08059603373209634, "text": "shining. [...]", "h": 0.012951164916964648}, {"w": 0.33989264594184027, "x": 0.14490161996289025, "text": "We can go in here now but you mustn't talk inside / in", "y": 0.5298401166667409, "h": 0.012732085312316574}, {"w": 0.32737030029296876, "h": 0.012649913892849272, "x": 0.1466905247864314, "text": "and you mustn't use your mobile phone. There are", "y": 0.5424854653458833}, {"text": "lots of computers, so we can do our homework here.", "x": 0.14669053279831057, "y": 0.5563131769198207, "h": 0.011462985651587725, "w": 0.33989264594184027}, {"text": "There's wifi too, so you can 2", "y": 0.568876354137122, "w": 0.18962432861328124, "h": 0.012955776173285286, "x": 0.14669052179950118}, {"w": 0.09234586079915363, "y": 0.5680538687566531, "h": 0.015109277804405715, "text": "_the Internet.", "x": 0.3607043849391425}, {"w": 0.1198568810356988, "h": 0.013909883895075349, "text": "Oh, and you can 3", "y": 0.5829505811691775, "x": 0.14490161416909153}, {"x": 0.2985584975576315, "w": 0.18855653550889762, "text": "books for / until three days,", "y": 0.5782631870977083, "h": 0.019974160710827124}, {"h": 0.011380813483296684, "text": "so you can read them at home.", "x": 0.14490161219593303, "y": 0.5981250002192892, "w": 0.20214669121636283}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.14311270949951108, "text": "You can also borrow DVDs and CDs from here. |...]", "w": 0.33094811333550345, "y": 0.6120348841402147}, {"y": 0.6258032490465301, "w": 0.3291592068142361, "x": 0.14311270193405246, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "We have a big school meeting here every morning"}, {"h": 0.011554287852793457, "y": 0.63859011649309, "x": 0.1449016274269838, "text": "before classes - called assembly. All the teachers", "w": 0.3166368272569444}, {"y": 0.6536777977736524, "h": 0.009029783393501837, "x": 0.14490161443550972, "text": "and students have to come - [that's round / around", "w": 0.3381037394205729}, {"y": 0.6618212911099826, "h": 0.02021068266582837, "x": 0.14278457596632854, "w": 0.2849992201063368, "text": "three hundred people! The headteacher"}, {"text": "-uS", "x": 0.42754919715414935, "w": 0.04651162465413411, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "y": 0.6689389535287414}, {"text": "important information and sometimes visitors come", "x": 0.14311270291116002, "w": 0.3345259263780382, "h": 0.011440160007683312, "y": 0.6803197678666365}, {"w": 0.20214669121636286, "h": 0.012672738787929946, "x": 0.1431127039744064, "y": 0.6929377258563757, "text": "and give speeches. We don't 5"}, {"h": 0.010225334339623852, "x": 0.37923290158792394, "y": 0.6941751236530221, "text": "lessons in", "w": 0.06979895697699656}, {"text": "here, it's only for assembly and for doing exams. But", "y": 0.7068749998602385, "h": 0.013937274368231051, "w": 0.3398926459418403, "x": 0.1413238050851323}, {"y": 0.7207848838350641, "x": 0.1431127038584845, "text": "we do drama here and sometimes we", "w": 0.255813954671224, "h": 0.010234971700592671}, {"h": 0.01138081348329678, "w": 0.04472271813286677, "text": "_sport", "x": 0.43291592235127685, "y": 0.7233139536444346}, {"h": 0.011522332175974353, "text": "in here if the weather is really bad.", "x": 0.1431127075432707, "y": 0.7345532489684719, "w": 0.22182467990451388}, {"text": "2 Choose the correct words a j in the dialogue in Exercise 1.", "y": 0.7675315881896514, "h": 0.012686434773331584, "x": 0.08228981329889437, "w": 0.4132379150390625}, {"w": 0.3955466037326389, "h": 0.013660362360709898, "x": 0.08217912389956723, "text": "3 Complete the sentences with the correct prepositions", "y": 0.7872175209084238}, {"x": 0.10375670931771888, "y": 0.8004505816177994, "text": "from Exercise 1.", "w": 0.1144901614718967, "h": 0.011444725211346617}, {"text": "I never get bored in English lessons.", "w": 0.25223612467447915, "x": 0.12522362344093557, "y": 0.8193546931792843, "h": 0.011444725211346617}, {"x": 0.10375670865356044, "text": "1", "y": 0.8333284884339834, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "h": 0.007587208988864585}, {"y": 0.8333284885911593, "w": 0.2701252068413628, "h": 0.012722955653813801, "x": 0.12522362648390994, "text": "I don't want to go out my friends."}, {"h": 0.01656677701412985, "x": 0.11091234928732872, "y": 0.8459738369689863, "text": "Is that Natalie there?", "w": 0.1985688612196181}, {"y": 0.8609702166504312, "x": 0.12343471273405862, "w": 0.09302324930826822, "h": 0.007851985559566801, "text": "Can we stav"}, {"x": 0.24329159405572165, "h": 0.007851985559566801, "text": "todav? It's raining and cold outcide", "y": 0.8609702167403226, "w": 0.24150268554687498}, {"x": 0.5563506275959849, "w": 0.028622538248697982, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "N:", "y": 0.30348837225984626}, {"w": 0.35062611897786455, "x": 0.5849731600698038, "text": "Excuse me, it's my first day here. I have to borrow", "y": 0.3034792419418681, "h": 0.011389943890623293}, {"y": 0.31722021643878445, "x": 0.5939177180423366, "w": 0.2790697564019097, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "some books. Where's the school libran?"}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "y": 0.33130813973287454, "w": 0.1252236090766059, "text": "Walk along this 'c", "x": 0.5939177134998604}, {"h": 0.012686434773331489, "text": "_. Be quiet when you", "y": 0.33253158837933167, "w": 0.1484794277615018, "x": 0.7835420405691595}, {"x": 0.5934005100055532, "text": "go past the 's", "h": 0.014023204882652688, "w": 0.09930297851562497, "y": 0.3451642887371533}, {"text": "- . Don't wake", "y": 0.34648255852215976, "h": 0.01156798308937126, "x": 0.82289803224189, "w": 0.1180679745144314}, {"x": 0.552772809601225, "y": 0.3730377910750305, "w": 0.023255812327067082, "h": 0.011380813483296684, "text": "N:"}, {"text": "J:", "x": 0.5527728085049337, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.38821220956549407, "w": 0.016100178824530742}, {"x": 0.5921288033021658, "text": "the teachers up!", "w": 0.11627906799316401, "y": 0.3603924422481361, "h": 0.012645348314774242}, {"h": 0.011380813483296684, "x": 0.5939177102671306, "text": "Eh?", "y": 0.3730377908695435, "w": 0.026833631727430585}, {"x": 0.5921288039194689, "w": 0.2522361246744791, "text": "Sorry. Just joking. So, go past the 'c", "y": 0.3869476743789521, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"x": 0.5921288075198855, "h": 0.013923579131653152, "y": 0.40084386276319545, "w": 0.2629695807562934, "text": "and the lovely smell of chips, then the"}, {"y": 0.41476744198175286, "x": 0.5903398931479081, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "w": 0.017889086405436183, "text": "4s"}, {"x": 0.7584973174834099, "y": 0.4160319765917178, "text": ".. Careful, I think Class 8C", "w": 0.17710196601019967, "h": 0.010116279400643058}, {"y": 0.42867732576674084, "x": 0.5939177186544712, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.30590338812934026, "text": "are doing Chemistry in there at the moment!"}, {"text": "Go upstairs, walk by the sh", "w": 0.18604649861653655, "x": 0.5921288057006763, "y": 0.4424593863341034, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"text": "- someone", "x": 0.8550983909598381, "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "y": 0.4451162791843467, "w": 0.08050089518229164}, {"y": 0.4577616281631481, "x": 0.5921288191661308, "text": "is giving a speech to all the Year 12 students now,", "h": 0.011394509094286501, "w": 0.343470458984375}, {"y": 0.47033393475705015, "w": 0.16636850992838548, "text": "and then go past the g", "x": 0.5903398940340184, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"text": ". The students", "y": 0.4715117330277927, "w": 0.10196779886881513, "h": 0.010276057410326177, "x": 0.8300536686693492}, {"y": 0.48431686036223703, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "aren't in there today. They're all outside playing", "w": 0.33094811333550345, "x": 0.5903399009574719}, {"text": "football on the 's", "x": 0.5885509834942447, "y": 0.4969622096267698, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.12343470255533862}, {"y": 0.49916077355439453, "text": "_. So, at the", "h": 0.012041824496610051, "w": 0.08603822496202251, "x": 0.8585909062676766}, {"text": "top of the stairs, turn right. That's room 21 and the", "x": 0.590339885274385, "w": 0.34883721245659727, "y": 0.511949458229859, "h": 0.012955776173285286}, {"x": 0.5509839003526809, "y": 0.5399563954416728, "w": 0.01967799504597989, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "text": "N:"}, {"w": 0.017889086405436183, "text": "J:", "x": 0.5491949918598937, "y": 0.5551308143308443, "h": 0.01138081348329678}, {"x": 0.5885509857692599, "h": 0.012695565180658001, "text": "library is next to it. OK?", "y": 0.5272608300334151, "w": 0.16636850992838537}, {"text": "I think so. Thanks. Err...", "x": 0.5903398962391957, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "w": 0.16457960340711808, "y": 0.5412209304415322}, {"w": 0.35062611897786455, "text": "Where are you going? That's the wrong way. That's", "x": 0.5903398957167921, "h": 0.011389943890623196, "y": 0.5551308141253575}, {"w": 0.1341681501600478, "x": 0.5903398973484197, "y": 0.5676985563036324, "text": "the door to the ®p_", "h": 0.012722954904990062}, {"text": "_. You can't go outside", "w": 0.16100179036458329, "h": 0.011545157445466848, "x": 0.7799642222467909, "y": 0.5688763538841174}, {"w": 0.3005366685655382, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "now. It isn't break time. OK, come with me.", "x": 0.5885509896886083, "y": 0.5829505816565664}, {"w": 0.159212883843316, "x": 0.540250446253655, "text": "REMEMBER BETTER", "y": 0.610770348958497, "h": 0.011499506532069942}, {"text": "Learning collocations is a useful way to build up your", "y": 0.6360108306136342, "w": 0.3649373711480035, "h": 0.012695564431834358, "x": 0.5420393705977332}, {"w": 0.3720929972330729, "h": 0.011472115684502416, "text": "vocabulary. Knowing which verbs collocate with which", "x": 0.5402504555873993, "y": 0.6512354653987948}, {"y": 0.6638808142779327, "text": "nouns. e.g. knowing when to use make and when to use", "x": 0.5402504474318406, "w": 0.386404283311632, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"text": "do, makes your English better. It's also good to know", "x": 0.5420393679326069, "y": 0.6790552327458153, "w": 0.3631484646267361, "h": 0.011526897379637562}, {"x": 0.538461548651253, "text": "that there may be different verbs which collocate with", "y": 0.6917005814473751, "w": 0.3703040907118056, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"x": 0.5402504610278576, "text": "one noun, e.g. the Internet (use, surf, access).", "h": 0.011380813483296684, "w": 0.31305901421440974, "y": 0.7068750002192892}, {"text": "WORD STORE 5D | Nouns and verbs", "x": 0.5259391839453882, "y": 0.7435465120471914, "w": 0.28085866292317707, "h": 0.012645348314774242}, {"text": "5 Cross out the words which do not collocate with", "h": 0.0114218995674423, "x": 0.525939175122803, "y": 0.767531588516866, "w": 0.37030412462022577}, {"w": 0.289803229437934, "x": 0.545617169789083, "h": 0.012659043551352046, "text": "the verbs. Use a dictionary if necessary.", "y": 0.7827470934109269}, {"x": 0.5688729882682068, "y": 0.8017151164121717, "text": "wear", "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.041144900851779465}, {"x": 0.6422182507006947, "y": 0.7991860462506818, "w": 0.22182467990451393, "h": 0.013909883895075349, "text": "equipment / a uniform / glasses"}, {"y": 0.8143604651516023, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "x": 0.5456171737474781, "text": "1"}, {"h": 0.008851743820341854, "text": "2", "x": 0.5456171740336464, "y": 0.8295348838247492, "w": 0.010733451843261799}, {"x": 0.5688729873475473, "y": 0.814360465465183, "text": "do", "w": 0.021466905805799685, "h": 0.01138081348329678}, {"x": 0.6422182476962608, "w": 0.22898032294379345, "y": 0.8142509025616335, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "homework / dinner / experiments"}, {"w": 0.05372955322265627, "x": 0.5706307516536931, "h": 0.00904217417920113, "y": 0.8294396686883229, "text": "borrow"}, {"h": 0.012677304366004975, "y": 0.828270348887671, "text": "a book from the library / a DVD from", "w": 0.2504472181532118, "x": 0.6440071577689518}, {"text": "a friend / an email from someone", "y": 0.8433032489265435, "w": 0.22898032294379345, "h": 0.010257797344496987, "x": 0.6422182492615558}, {"h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.8586191861408463, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "x": 0.54